            },
            {
              "key": "answer",
              "html": "<p><span data-effect=\"spaced\">50</span></p>",
              "title": "Ответ",
              "asset_keys": [],
              "section_id": "answer:1",
              "transformation_target_id": "section:answer:1"
            },
            {
              "key": "solution",
              "html": "<p>За­да­ча сво­дит­ся к ре­ше­нию не­ра­вен­ства <span data-inline-latex=\"U_0\\cos (\\omega t+\\varphi)\\ge 1\"></span> при за­дан­ных зна­че­ни­ях ам­пли­ту­ды сиг­на­ла, ча­сто­ты и фазы:</p><center><p><span><span data-inline-latex=\"2\\cos(240^\\circ t-120^\\circ)\\ge 1\\Leftrightarrow \\cos(240^\\circ t-120^\\circ)\\ge \\frac{1}{2}\\Leftrightarrow \\begin{cases}240^\\circ t-120^\\circ\\ge -60^\\circ+360^\\circ n,\\\\240^\\circ t-120^\\circ\\le 60^\\circ+360^\\circ n,\\end{cases}\\quad n\\in\\mathbb{Z}\\Leftrightarrow \\begin{cases}240^\\circ t\\ge 60^\\circ+360^\\circ n,\\\\240^\\circ t\\le 180^\\circ+360^\\circ n\\end{cases}\\Leftrightarrow 1{,}5n+\\frac{1}{4}\\le t\\le \\frac{3}{4}+1{,}5n\\underset{0\\le t\\le 1}{\\Leftrightarrow}\\frac{1}{4}\\le t\\le \\frac{3}{4}.\"></span></span></p><p><span></span></p></center><p>На про­тя­же­нии пер­вой се­кун­ды лам­поч­ка будет го­реть  <span data-inline-latex=\"\\frac{3}{4}-\\frac{1}{4}=\\frac{1}{2}=0{,}5\"></span>  с, то есть 50% вре­ме­ни. </p>",
              "title": "Решение",
              "asset_keys": [],
              "section_id": "solution:1",
              "transformation_target_id": "section:solution:1"
            }
          ],
